[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_TANK]
Water Tank

[l_english.MODULE_SPECIAL_TANK_desc]
You are not mistaken, it is not a fuel tank, but a water tank. According to the law of momentum, when you connect the water tank to the water pipe and spray water backwards, your aircraft will accelerate forward.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_TANK]
水箱

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_SPECIAL_TANK_desc]
你没有看错，不是油箱，而是水箱。根据动量定理，当你接上水箱的喷水管向后喷水时，你的飞行器就会加速向前。
